{"id": "h5_chart_01_intent_reflex_warfarin", "round": "h5", "class": "A single active order with intent reflex-order. FHIR defines a reflex order as one generated automatically from another result, so it is conditional, yet the printed text gives its dose as one fixed daily dose.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:m1}} {{dose:m1}} {{route:m1}} {{frequency:m1}}.\", \"medicationRequests\": [{\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"reflex-order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Warfarin\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 5, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}]}"}
{"id": "h5_chart_02_intent_instance_lisinopril", "round": "h5", "class": "A single active order with intent instance-order, which FHIR describes as one instance of an order rather than a standing order. The printed text gives it as a daily standing dose.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:m1}} {{dose:m1}} {{route:m1}} {{frequency:m1}}.\", \"medicationRequests\": [{\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"instance-order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Lisinopril\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 10, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}]}"}
{"id": "h5_chart_03_reflex_beside_active_lisinopril", "round": "h5", "class": "An active standing lisinopril 10 mg order beside an active reflex-order for warfarin 5 mg. Both orders are active, so the text must give both, and the second is conditional in FHIR terms but printed as a fixed daily dose.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:m1}} {{dose:m1}} {{route:m1}} {{frequency:m1}}. Take {{drug:m2}} {{dose:m2}} {{route:m2}} {{frequency:m2}}.\", \"medicationRequests\": [{\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Lisinopril\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 10, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}, {\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m2\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"reflex-order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Warfarin\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 5, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}]}"}
{"id": "h5_chart_04_filler_order_control", "round": "h5", "class": "Control. A single active warfarin 5 mg order with intent filler-order, an ordinary active intent. The text should release and a labeler should call it faithful.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:m1}} {{dose:m1}} {{route:m1}} {{frequency:m1}}.\", \"medicationRequests\": [{\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"filler-order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Warfarin\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 5, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}]}"}
{"id": "h5_chart_05_dnp_same_dose_printed_order", "round": "h5", "class": "An active warfarin 5 mg once-daily order and a second warfarin 5 mg once-daily order with doNotPerform true. The second is a prohibition of the very order printed. The reader drops it from the duplicate check, so the text prints the active order alone.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:m1}} {{dose:m1}} {{route:m1}} {{frequency:m1}}.\", \"medicationRequests\": [{\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Warfarin\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 5, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}, {\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m2\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Warfarin\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 5, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}], \"doNotPerform\": true}]}"}
{"id": "h5_chart_06_proposal_beside_active_metformin", "round": "h5", "class": "An active metformin 500 mg once-daily order beside a proposal (intent proposal, status active) for metformin 1000 mg twice a day. A proposal is a suggestion, not an order, so the reader treats it as inactive and the text prints only the 500 mg order.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:m1}} {{dose:m1}} {{route:m1}} {{frequency:m1}}.\", \"medicationRequests\": [{\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Metformin\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 500, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}, {\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m2\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"proposal\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Metformin\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 2, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 1000, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}]}"}
{"id": "h5_chart_07_id_hld_warfarin", "round": "h5", "class": "Order id hld-1 on a fixed once-daily 5 mg warfarin order. Hld is the clinical abbreviation for hold, a three-letter prefix that no word list or stop list contains, so the opaque id rule admits it.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:hld-1}} {{dose:hld-1}} {{route:hld-1}} {{frequency:hld-1}}.\", \"medicationRequests\": [{\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"hld-1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Warfarin\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 5, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}]}"}
{"id": "h5_chart_08_id_eod_warfarin", "round": "h5", "class": "Order id eod-2 on a fixed once-daily 5 mg warfarin order. EOD is the clinical abbreviation for every other day, and the three-letter prefix passes the opaque id rule.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:eod-2}} {{dose:eod-2}} {{route:eod-2}} {{frequency:eod-2}}.\", \"medicationRequests\": [{\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"eod-2\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Warfarin\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 5, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}]}"}
{"id": "h5_chart_09_id_mwf_lisinopril", "round": "h5", "class": "Order id mwf-1 on a fixed once-daily 10 mg lisinopril order. MWF is the usual abbreviation for Monday, Wednesday, and Friday, a schedule on three weekdays, and the prefix passes the opaque id rule.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:mwf-1}} {{dose:mwf-1}} {{route:mwf-1}} {{frequency:mwf-1}}.\", \"medicationRequests\": [{\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"mwf-1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Lisinopril\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 10, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}]}"}
{"id": "h5_chart_10_id_digit_pattern_lisinopril", "round": "h5", "class": "Order id 1-0-1 on a fixed once-daily 10 mg lisinopril order. The id has digits and hyphens only, so it passes the opaque id rule, and it reads as a three-dose morning, noon, and night pattern.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:1-0-1}} {{dose:1-0-1}} {{route:1-0-1}} {{frequency:1-0-1}}.\", \"medicationRequests\": [{\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"1-0-1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Lisinopril\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 10, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}]}"}
{"id": "h5_chart_11_id_sli_lispro", "round": "h5", "class": "Order id sli-4 on a fixed 4 unit insulin lispro order three times a day. SLI is the usual abbreviation for sliding scale, so the id marks a variable dose printed as one fixed dose.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:sli-4}} {{dose:sli-4}} {{route:sli-4}} {{frequency:sli-4}}.\", \"medicationRequests\": [{\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"sli-4\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Insulin lispro\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 3, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"34206005\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 4, \"unit\": \"[iU]\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"[iU]\"}}]}]}]}"}
{"id": "h5_chart_12_id_tpr_prednisone", "round": "h5", "class": "Order id tpr-6 on a fixed once-daily 10 mg prednisone order. TPR is a common abbreviation for taper, and the id would mark a six-step taper printed as one fixed dose.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:tpr-6}} {{dose:tpr-6}} {{route:tpr-6}} {{frequency:tpr-6}}.\", \"medicationRequests\": [{\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"tpr-6\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Prednisone\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 10, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}]}"}
{"id": "h5_chart_13_medication_id_hld_metformin", "round": "h5", "class": "A metformin 500 mg once-daily order referenced to a Medication resource with id hld-2. The Medication id carries the hold abbreviation, the same prefix as request 07, through the medicationReference path.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:m1}} {{dose:m1}} {{route:m1}} {{frequency:m1}}.\", \"bundle\": {\"resourceType\": \"Bundle\", \"type\": \"searchset\", \"entry\": [{\"resource\": {\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationReference\": {\"reference\": \"Medication/hld-2\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 500, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}}, {\"resource\": {\"resourceType\": \"Medication\", \"id\": \"hld-2\", \"code\": {\"text\": \"Metformin\"}}}]}}"}
{"id": "h5_chart_14_bundle_id_eod_warfarin", "round": "h5", "class": "A bundle id eod-2 around one active warfarin 5 mg once-daily order. The bundle id is checked for shape only, so the abbreviation EOD (every other day) reaches the labeler on the bundle itself.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:m1}} {{dose:m1}} {{route:m1}} {{frequency:m1}}.\", \"bundle\": {\"resourceType\": \"Bundle\", \"type\": \"searchset\", \"entry\": [{\"resource\": {\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Warfarin\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 5, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}}], \"id\": \"eod-2\"}}"}
