{"id": "h5_chart_19_patient_identifier_hold_warfarin", "round": "h5", "class": "A warfarin 5 mg once-daily order with a Patient whose identifier value is hold warfarin if INR above 3. The identifier key is admitted for Patient and its value is never read.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:m1}} {{dose:m1}} {{route:m1}} {{frequency:m1}}.\", \"bundle\": {\"resourceType\": \"Bundle\", \"type\": \"searchset\", \"entry\": [{\"resource\": {\"resourceType\": \"Patient\", \"id\": \"p1\", \"identifier\": [{\"system\": \"urn:example:chart-note\", \"value\": \"hold warfarin if INR above 3\"}]}}, {\"resource\": {\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Warfarin\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 5, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}}]}}"}
{"id": "h5_chart_20_patient_deceased_past_warfarin", "round": "h5", "class": "A warfarin 5 mg once-daily active order for a Patient whose deceasedDateTime is 2019-05-01. The reader admits the field and never reads the date against the order.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:m1}} {{dose:m1}} {{route:m1}} {{frequency:m1}}.\", \"bundle\": {\"resourceType\": \"Bundle\", \"type\": \"searchset\", \"entry\": [{\"resource\": {\"resourceType\": \"Patient\", \"id\": \"p1\", \"deceasedDateTime\": \"2019-05-01T00:00:00Z\"}}, {\"resource\": {\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Warfarin\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 5, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}}]}}"}
{"id": "h5_chart_21_requester_rn1_doctor_framing", "round": "h5", "class": "The text says These are from your doctor over a lisinopril 10 mg order whose requester is Practitioner/rn1. The rn abbreviation (registered nurse) is an id that passes the opaque id rule, and the reader never compares the requester with the framing.", "request": "{\"output\": \"These are from your doctor. Take {{drug:m1}} {{dose:m1}} {{route:m1}} {{frequency:m1}}.\", \"medicationRequests\": [{\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Lisinopril\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 10, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}], \"requester\": {\"reference\": \"Practitioner/rn1\"}}]}"}
{"id": "h5_chart_22_recorder_md1_pharmacist_framing", "round": "h5", "class": "The text says These are from your pharmacist over a lisinopril 10 mg order whose recorder is Practitioner/md1. MD is a doctor credential, so the framing attributes the order to a profession the record does not name, and the reader never checks it.", "request": "{\"output\": \"These are from your pharmacist. Take {{drug:m1}} {{dose:m1}} {{route:m1}} {{frequency:m1}}.\", \"medicationRequests\": [{\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Lisinopril\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 10, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}], \"recorder\": {\"reference\": \"Practitioner/md1\"}}]}"}
{"id": "h5_chart_23_authored_future_warfarin", "round": "h5", "class": "A warfarin 5 mg once-daily active order with authoredOn 2031-06-01. A future authoring date makes the order not yet in effect in real time, and the reader does not compare authoredOn with the present.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:m1}} {{dose:m1}} {{route:m1}} {{frequency:m1}}.\", \"medicationRequests\": [{\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Warfarin\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 5, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}], \"authoredOn\": \"2031-06-01T09:00:00Z\"}]}"}
{"id": "h5_chart_24_priority_stat_warfarin", "round": "h5", "class": "A warfarin 5 mg once-daily active order with priority stat. A stat order is one for immediate action, and the reader admits the priority code and never prints it.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:m1}} {{dose:m1}} {{route:m1}} {{frequency:m1}}.\", \"medicationRequests\": [{\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Warfarin\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 5, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}], \"priority\": \"stat\"}]}"}
{"id": "h5_chart_25_bundle_total_include_warfarin", "round": "h5", "class": "A searchset bundle with total 3 that holds one warfarin 5 mg once-daily order with search mode include. The total and the search mode are admitted, and the text prints the one order as if it were the full chart.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:m1}} {{dose:m1}} {{route:m1}} {{frequency:m1}}.\", \"bundle\": {\"resourceType\": \"Bundle\", \"type\": \"searchset\", \"entry\": [{\"resource\": {\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Warfarin\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 5, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}, \"search\": {\"mode\": \"include\"}}], \"total\": 3}}"}
{"id": "h5_chart_26_medication_ndc_code_warfarin", "round": "h5", "class": "A warfarin 5 mg once-daily order referenced to a Medication resource with an NDC coding of 0056-0170-70 and no display. The NDC is checked for shape only, and a labeler cannot confirm which product it names.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:m1}} {{dose:m1}} {{route:m1}} {{frequency:m1}}.\", \"bundle\": {\"resourceType\": \"Bundle\", \"type\": \"searchset\", \"entry\": [{\"resource\": {\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationReference\": {\"reference\": \"Medication/med-1\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 5, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}}, {\"resource\": {\"resourceType\": \"Medication\", \"id\": \"med-1\", \"code\": {\"text\": \"Warfarin\", \"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/ndc\", \"code\": \"0056-0170-70\"}]}}}]}}"}
